    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80eb-a5af-e4ec9387a522",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80e2-8635-fc3560ec38c9"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-05T07:45:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-05T08:21:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "The startups of yore (especially the consumer ones, like AirBnB & Uber) seemed like “communities” for their staff, and “fields” for their users. ",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "The startups of yore (especially the consumer ones, like AirBnB & Uber) seemed like “communities” for their staff, and “fields” for their users. ",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80e0-a132-da6893c02b1b",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80e2-8635-fc3560ec38c9"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-05T07:47:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-05T08:07:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "But historically, as startups grow in headcount, they struggle with internal comms and overhead and maintaining product velocity. Have any large tech companies cracked this code?",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "But historically, as startups grow in headcount, they struggle with internal comms and overhead and maintaining product velocity. Have any large tech companies cracked this code?",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80ab-883f-dd140390b06c",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80e2-8635-fc3560ec38c9"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-05T08:04:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-05T08:25:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Or, looking broader than tech: what is the largest community that exists today? Maybe the Catholic church? (Perhaps, Jesus is the best community builder of all time.)",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Or, looking broader than tech: what is the largest community that exists today? Maybe the Catholic church? (Perhaps, Jesus is the best community builder of all time.)",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "40fa6e41-f23e-8033-b387-f60364d3b2ee",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "40fa6e41-f23e-80e2-8635-fc3560ec38c9"
